# ---- g7250-emu .gitignore (repo-structure logic from spec §13) ----

# Decrypted firmware images NEVER live in the repo: they sit in the local
# image-map outside any git work tree (see SECURITY.md). These patterns are a
# second line of defence for vendor blobs and any build blob that slips in.
*.bbf
*.ctl
*.bin
*.dmg

# Locally installed tooling (Renode portable, cross-toolchains): not committed.
/tools/

# Generated artifacts (§13 ".private/"): golden sets, recordings, heatmaps,
# run logs, build output, measurement reports. Everything generated goes here,
# never in the scratchpad, never tracked.
/.private/

# Local configuration (image-map path, host-specific settings).
local.config*

.DS_Store
